{"seq":2,"slug":"photo-mode-value","title":"价值与营销：拍照模式作为 UGC 引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-photo-mode/foundations/photo-mode-value","wordCount":1692,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"价值与营销-拍照模式作为-ugc-引擎\">价值与营销：拍照模式作为 UGC 引擎</h1><p>一张玩家拍的游戏照片，如果被发到社交平台、被几千人看到，其中一部分人因此对这款游戏产生兴趣——这条链路里，厂商没有花一分钱投放，照片的拍摄者、传播者、看到的潜在买家全是玩家自己。这就是为什么营销团队比工程团队更舍不得砍掉拍照模式：它是一台由玩家自己驱动、自己供油的用户生成内容（UGC）引擎。上一篇 <a href=\"why-photo-mode\">为何拍照模式</a> 讲的是玩家的内在动机，这一篇换到厂商视角，讲清这台引擎如何运转、如何衡量、又有哪些被高估的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从一张照片到一次转化\">核心概念：从一张照片到一次转化</h2><p>拍照模式的商业价值，核心是把游戏内的审美体验转化为游戏外的传播素材。理解它要抓住一条「素材生产—社交分发—注意力获取—转化」的漏斗。和买量投放不同，这条漏斗的每一环都由玩家无偿完成，厂商要做的只是降低生产摩擦、提高分享意愿。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[玩家进入拍照模式] --&gt; B[创作一张满意的照片]&#10;  B --&gt; C{分享意愿}&#10;  C --&gt;|一键分享按钮| D[社交平台曝光]&#10;  C --&gt;|放弃| E[仅本地保存]&#10;  D --&gt; F[非玩家看到画面]&#10;  F --&gt; G[兴趣/搜索/愿望单]&#10;  G --&gt; H[潜在购买转化]&#10;  D --&gt; I[话题标签聚合&lt;br/&gt;形成社群]&#10;  I --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n  A[玩家进入拍照模式] --&gt; B[创作一张满意的照片]\n  B --&gt; C{分享意愿}\n  C --&gt;|一键分享按钮| D[社交平台曝光]\n  C --&gt;|放弃| E[仅本地保存]\n  D --&gt; F[非玩家看到画面]\n  F --&gt; G[兴趣/搜索/愿望单]\n  G --&gt; H[潜在购买转化]\n  D --&gt; I[话题标签聚合&lt;br/&gt;形成社群]\n  I --&gt; D</pre><p>这条漏斗里，工程能直接影响的是前两环（降低创作与分享摩擦），而后面几环是社群自组织的结果。下面的对比表说明了为什么这种自驱漏斗对厂商格外有吸引力。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统买量投放</th>\n<th>拍照模式 UGC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>素材成本</td>\n<td>厂商出钱制作</td>\n<td>玩家无偿创作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可信度</td>\n<td>广告，玩家有戒心</td>\n<td>真实玩家作品，可信度高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续性</td>\n<td>投放停即停</td>\n<td>只要游戏在玩就持续产出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触达精度</td>\n<td>依赖平台算法</td>\n<td>沿玩家社交关系自然扩散</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边际成本</td>\n<td>随规模线性上升</td>\n<td>接近零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可控性</td>\n<td>高（厂商定调）</td>\n<td>低（玩家自由发挥）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"降低生产摩擦-工程能做的事\">降低生产摩擦：工程能做的事</h2><p>漏斗的转化率，很大程度上取决于「拍出一张满意照片」有多容易。这里有几个被反复验证的设计杠杆，它们都属于本 hub 后续章节的技术职责：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>入口要近</strong>。拍照触发键应当随手可按，而不是埋在三级菜单里。很多游戏把它绑在十字键或一个长按手势上。入口的可达性直接决定有多少玩家会「顺手拍一张」。</li>\n<li><strong>默认就好看</strong>。多数玩家不会逐项调参数。提供几个一键风格预设（电影、复古、黑白），让零操作也能出片，是放大漏斗最上层流量的关键。预设的实现见 <a href=\"../tools/post-processing-filters\">后处理与滤镜</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>分享要顺</strong>。在主机平台，拍照模式通常直接接入系统级分享；在 PC，则提供一键导出到指定目录或社交客户端。每多一步操作，分享率都会显著衰减。</li>\n<li><strong>画质要够</strong>。发到社交平台被压缩后仍要清晰，因此高分辨率捕获不只是炫技，而是传播质量的下限保障，详见 <a href=\"../practice/capture-resolution\">高分辨率捕获</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"衡量回报-别只看-拍了多少张\">衡量回报：别只看「拍了多少张」</h2><p>拍照模式难以像内购那样直接归因收入，但并非不可衡量。常见的可观测指标分三层：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>参与层</strong>：拍照模式触发率（多少比例的玩家用过）、人均拍摄张数、平均停留时长。这一层反映功能是否被使用。</li>\n<li><strong>传播层</strong>：一键分享触发数、带特定话题标签的社交帖数量与互动量。这一层反映 UGC 是否真的流出游戏。注意要在分享元数据里埋入可识别的来源标记，否则无法归因，这一点在 <a href=\"../practice/photo-mode-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 的元数据部分展开。</li>\n<li><strong>转化层</strong>：从社交帖跳转到商店页的点击、愿望单新增。这一层最接近收入，但归因链最长、噪声最大，通常只能做相关性判断而非因果归因。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个务实的做法是把这些指标接入游戏遥测系统统一采集，而不是为拍照模式单独造轮子；遥测的采集与隐私边界属于另一个领域，本篇不展开。可以用一个简单的漏斗转化模型粗估规模：若拍照触发率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、分享率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、单帖平均触达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>、看到者的兴趣转化率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则每个活跃玩家带来的潜在新触达约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = p_1 \\cdot p_2 \\cdot r \\cdot p_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这个式子的价值不在精确，而在提醒团队：提升任何一环（尤其工程可控的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）都会线性放大整体回报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"被高估与被低估的地方\">被高估与被低估的地方</h2><p>营销叙事里，拍照模式常被吹成「免费病毒营销」，但实践中有几个需要冷静看待的点。被高估的是「病毒性」——绝大多数照片只在小圈子里流传，真正破圈的是极少数现象级作品，不能把个例当常态来排期。被高估的还有「转化归因」——很难证明某次销量增长直接来自拍照分享。</p>\n<p>反过来，被低估的是<strong>留存与口碑</strong>价值。拍照模式让玩家在通关后仍有回到世界里的理由，延长生命周期；它还塑造了「这款游戏很美、很用心」的口碑底色，这种品牌资产难以量化却长期有效。被低估的还有它作为<strong>可访问性放大器</strong>的作用：暂停世界、自由观察，对行动或反应受限的玩家也是一种更友好的体验方式，相关无障碍设计可参考 UI/UX hub 的 <a href=\"../game-ui-ux/advanced-inclusive/accessibility\">无障碍设计</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>拍照模式是一台玩家自驱的 UGC 营销引擎：素材、分发、触达都由玩家无偿完成，边际成本接近零。</li>\n<li>工程能直接放大漏斗的，是降低创作与分享摩擦：近入口、好默认、顺分享、够画质。</li>\n<li>回报可分参与、传播、转化三层衡量，但转化层归因噪声大，宜接入统一遥测、做相关性判断。</li>\n<li>用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = p_1 \\cdot p_2 \\cdot r \\cdot p_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 粗估规模，重点是提示「提升工程可控环节会线性放大回报」。</li>\n<li>别高估病毒性与可归因转化，别低估留存口碑与可访问性这两项长期价值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"why-photo-mode\">为何拍照模式</a>（玩家内在动机）、<a href=\"photo-mode-scope\">功能谱系</a>（用价值反推该做哪些功能）、<a href=\"../tools/post-processing-filters\">后处理与滤镜</a>（一键预设如何放大漏斗）、<a href=\"../practice/capture-resolution\">高分辨率捕获</a>（画质即传播下限）。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：拍照作为可访问性入口，见 UI/UX hub 的 <a href=\"../game-ui-ux/advanced-inclusive/accessibility\">无障碍设计</a>；社交分享入口的交互设计可参照 <a href=\"../game-ui-ux/foundations/player-feedback\">玩家反馈</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"价值与营销：拍照模式作为 UGC 引擎","id":"价值与营销-拍照模式作为-ugc-引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从一张照片到一次转化","id":"核心概念-从一张照片到一次转化"},{"level":2,"text":"降低生产摩擦：工程能做的事","id":"降低生产摩擦-工程能做的事"},{"level":2,"text":"衡量回报：别只看「拍了多少张」","id":"衡量回报-别只看-拍了多少张"},{"level":2,"text":"被高估与被低估的地方","id":"被高估与被低估的地方"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨链接"}],"prev":{"title":"为何拍照模式：从截图键到虚拟摄影","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-photo-mode/foundations/why-photo-mode"},"next":{"title":"功能谱系：从最简截图到电影级套件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-photo-mode/foundations/photo-mode-scope"}}